config BR2_PACKAGE_T48S_TOOLS
	bool "t48s-tools"
	help
	  Our test programs for the T48S, from native/ in this repo:
	  keytest, touchtest, membanner, cpubench, waterfall.

	  Building the screen fonts needs python3 with Pillow and the
	  DejaVu fonts on the build host (python3-pil, fonts-dejavu-core).
